d lighting as the in-world models • ALT Highlight is now kept between missions • Picking up loot with a full inventory now plays a denied sound • Damaged and broken gear icons now pulse the same way in the inventory and on the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T09:38:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041553","verified_at":"2026-10-25T11:32:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074630-1847286114030911","game_id":"steam-5074630","kind":"update","title":"Fleshgrinder update (v0.3.6.0)","summary":"October 21-22, 2026 - Monster Mutations, Visual Fixes & Surface Materials (v0.3.6.0) • Added monster mutations that roll from random packs with multiple bonuses and drop better loot, with variance set per difficulty • Mutated monsters now carry a slight tint and an outline • Constructs now show a silhouette while being built • Added surface materials to the 3D rendered monsters and character models • Added two new augmentations • Armor names corrected and tiers rearranged for better balance in p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:16:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030911","verified_at":"2026-10-22T07:15:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074630-1846651706696471","game_id":"steam-5074630","kind":"update","title":"Fleshgrinder update (v0.3.5.9)","summary":"October 19-20, 2026 - Wall Decals, HUD Redesign & Crash Fixes (v0.3.5.9) • Added wall decals to all missions for better visual immersion • Character HUD panels were redesigned for clarity and better visuals • The selected character's HUD panel now sits in the middle • HUD panels made consistent across the interface • Skill icon cooldowns now display properly with decimals • Strain stacks now show their cooldowns on the status icons • Corrected the heartbeat effect of operatives on the HUD • Mini","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T19:06:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696471","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074630-1846651706690925","game_id":"steam-5074630","kind":"announcement","title":"Flesgrinder participating in the Steam Next Fest starting now","summary":"With the recent patch now live (v0.3.5.8), bringing some bugfixed and more robust compatibility for a wider range of displays, Hainalcode's Fleshgrinder is hoping for more players, reviews and other feedback from players across the world. So don't hesitate to get out there and grind down some techno-organic mutants in this post-apocalyptic ARPG! Hope you enjoy!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:00:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690925","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074630-1846651706690816","game_id":"steam-5074630","kind":"update","title":"Fleshgrinder update (v0.3.5.8)","summary":"October 18-19, 2026 - Story Art, Refresh Rate Detection & Wall Collision Fixes (v0.3.5.8) • Wired in the finalized story art images • Monitor refresh rate is now auto-detected and fps cap is automatically set to it • Raised the max FPS cap to cover more monitor types • Changing monitors now resets the FPS cap to the active monitor's refresh rate • Hard wall collision anti-stuck behaviour made more robust • Movement overrides when colliding with pushable objects now apply earlier to prevent getti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:37:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690816","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074630-1846651706686908","game_id":"steam-5074630","kind":"update","title":"Fleshgrinder update (v0.3.5.7)","summary":"October 17-18, 2026 - Prebaked Atlases (v0.3.5.7) • Gameplay texture atlases are now prebaked and ship with the game for faster mission loading and as a possible solution to the legacy AMD GPU driver crashes • Fixed the demo so that late Genesis tier waves won't crash that tried to spawn monsters not included in it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T12:53:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686908","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074630-1846651706685340","game_id":"steam-5074630","kind":"update","title":"Fleshgrinder update (v0.3.5.6)","summary":"October 17, 2026 - Drone Fixes, Plasma Pistol Splash & Gore Physics (v0.3.5.6) • Hacksmith drones now orbit their owner evenly distributed • The plasma pistol now deals splash damage • Dismembered body parts flight tweaked so they feel more natural • Added old save compatibility for constructs • Native crashes are now captured in the logs for easier bug reports • Fixed the drone sound loop stopping after area changes • Raised minimum animation time for eating monsters to stop them from flickerin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T18:56:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685340","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074630-1846651706679397","game_id":"steam-5074630","kind":"update","title":"Fleshgrinder update (v0.3.5.5)","summary":"October 15, 2026 - Demo Mission Reset, Corpse Eating & Knockdown Fixes (v0.3.5.5) • The demo now allows resetting Mission 1 so players can keep playing and demo end scene now makes the hint appear to do so • Missions 1-2 and 6-7 are now interlinked for resets • Monsters now eat the character and NPC corpses they killed • HUD character panels and tooltips now display weapon ammo types • Added minimal stat requirements for tier 1 gear • Tier 1 armors were rebalanced • Controller fixes • Corrected ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T21:58:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679397","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074630-1846651706675411","game_id":"steam-5074630","kind":"update","title":"Fleshgrinder update (v0.3.5.4)","summary":"October 14, 2026 - Controller Hints, Dismemberment & Hub Follower Fixes (v0.3.5.4) • Hints now show controller buttons instead of keyboard keys when playing with a controller • Added Butcher and Fleshdrone dismemberment • Custom difficulty is now unlocked after finishing Act 1 in the beta • Autosave performance tweaks and faster mission exits • Vsync is now off by default • The text atlas was shrunk by dropping unused glyphs • Removed graphics settings polling and other checks in favor of one-ti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T19:18:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675411","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074630-1845383656388115","game_id":"steam-5074630","kind":"announcement","title":"Hacksmith is now playable in the demo","summary":"The Hacksmit